1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,483
The North Wind and the Sun
were disputing which was the stronger,

2
00:00:03,522 --> 00:00:06,798
when a traveler came along
wrapped in a warm cloak.

3
00:00:07,567 --> 00:00:09,703
They agreed that the one
who first succeeded

4
00:00:09,726 --> 00:00:11,761
in making the traveler take his cloak off

5
00:00:11,785 --> 00:00:14,005
should be considered
stronger than the other.

6
00:00:14,769 --> 00:00:18,253
Then the North Wind
blew as hard as he could,

7
00:00:18,304 --> 00:00:22,200
but the more he blew the more closely did
the traveler fold his cloak around him;

8
00:00:22,782 --> 00:00:25,829
and at last the North Wind
gave up the attempt.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,733
Then the Sun shone out warmly,

10
00:00:28,753 --> 00:00:31,486
and immediately
the traveler took off his cloak.

11
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:33,902
And so the North Wind
was obliged to confess

12
00:00:33,922 --> 00:00:36,218
that the Sun was the stronger of the two.
